flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[/Open SLA-SIMS page/]
    B --> C{Session object in localStorage?}
    C -- No --> D[/Show login page/]
    D --> E[Compare email and plaintext password with local users]
    E --> F{Match?}
    F -- No --> G[/Show warning or 60-second browser lock/]
    G --> D
    F -- Yes --> H[Save full user object as browser session]
    C -- Yes --> I[Load requested page]
    H --> I
    I --> J[Hide navigation and forms by role]
    J --> K[/User views or edits module/]
    K --> L{Write action?}
    L -- No --> M[(Read browser localStorage)]
    L -- Yes --> N[(Overwrite browser localStorage array)]
    M --> O[/Render dashboard, table, or report/]
    N --> O
    O --> P([End])
